woke up here in Abelina. Now you're heading out into the frontier with your companions following behind. There is no combat, instead you explore a vast world and a mature story about carrying life's baggage into the afterlife.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/c822b2a45684031e9b134e2aa655838b2596d3b6/header.jpg?t=1787847424", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/8f9a015ff21eee38c378129bcb4bacf8f284accf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787847424", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682900/8f9a015ff21eee38c378129bcb4bacf8f284accf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787847424", "website": "https://indieformer.com/abelina/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2300 | AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 | AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700 | AMD Ryzen 7 1800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 2060 | AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright Gabe Askew LLC", "developers": ["Gabe Askew"], "publishers": ["Indieformer"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "descript